    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***New Release Now on Sale***\r\n\r\nThe new release comprises a selection of 3-bedroom semi-detached homes, 4-bedroom semi-detached and detached homes. A brand new show house is now open, offering purchasers the opportunity to experience the quality and finish throughout the development. Viewings are strictly by appointment only.\r\n\r\nMillers Hill is an exclusive new homes scheme delivering high-quality family homes in the heart of Killenard village, County Laois. Each home is designed with modern layouts, generous living space, and premium specifications, ideal for families and commuters seeking comfort and style in a well-connected setting.\r\n\r\nKillenard is a well-established and highly regarded community known for its welcoming atmosphere and excellent local amenities. It is home to the renowned Heritage Hotel, Golf and Spa Resort, along with nearby shops, services, and recreational facilities. The local primary school is located adjacent to the development and can be reached via a direct footpath connection, offering exceptional convenience for families.\r\n\r\nMillers Hill also benefits from excellent commuter connectivity. Portarlington Train Station is just a 7-minute drive away, providing regular rail services to Dublin with an average journey time of approximately one hour. This makes Millers Hill an ideal choice for buyers seeking peaceful village living with straightforward access to Dublin.\r\n\r\nRegister your interest today to speak with a Kelly Walsh agent.\r\n\r\nFor further information, please contact the Kelly Walsh New Homes Team on (01) 664 5500.\r\n\r\nBER: A2"
      },
